Z||000010||Standard||01-05-2001||05:26 AM||||I use Inoculate IT Personal Edition.  Free download from  <A HREF="http://antivirus.ca.com" TARGET=_blank>antivirus.ca.com</A> .  Haven't had any virus trouble yet, but I have two younger siblings who go god-knows-where on the internet..||||reg||
